# (GLSL has no sampler2DDepth) -> Tint texture_2d<f32> over an UNFILTERABLE depth format ->
# a Float slot rejects the view -> every overlay/workbench depth-read pass drops. Fix:
# (a) infer_sample_type(Depth) -> UnfilterableFloat (only Shadow is a real depth sample
# type); (b) WGPUShader::build_explicit_layout builds ONE group-0 BindGroupLayout +
# PipelineLayout from interface_map_.entries, restricted to the @binding(N) that survive
