# so the layout is binding-/visibility-identical to the auto layout and differs only in the
# resource TYPE fields; the multi-viewport pass-state UBO (patch 0083, codegen-injected, not
# in the map) is added as a uniform entry, any OTHER uncovered binding falls the whole shader
# back to auto layout (logged, never a silent per-binding mix). wgpu_pipeline.cc (render) +
# WGPUShader::compute_pipeline set desc.layout to the explicit layout; the 5 draw/dispatch
# bind-group sites (batch x3, immediate, backend-compute) take the explicit BGL when present.
